This project provides the loader and AWS Neuron (NKI) kernel code needed to run
the official Qwen3.5-35B-A3B FP8 checkpoint on AWS Trainium2. It does NOT
redistribute model weights.

The FP8 weights are published separately by the Qwen team (Alibaba Cloud) under
the Apache License, Version 2.0:
  https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B-FP8
  https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B   (base model)

This repository contains original code only: a dependency-free safetensors
reader, CPU-side block-scaled FP8 (E4M3) conversion utilities, and a fused
Mixture-of-Experts NKI kernel. Users download the weights directly from the
Qwen repositories above.
